        mlt:literatureCitation "Equid skull evolution has a modern GM literature (e.g. Dryad 10.5061/dryad.crjdfn3g3, 'horses deviate from a pervasive pattern of skull shape evolution') -- its very title signals that horse skulls do NOT follow the simple pervasive pattern, but it is not a test of Thompson's Eohippus->Equus grid" ;
        mlt:literatureRelation "NO_DIRECT_TEST" ;
